            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>Sacred to Cautopatus. Marcus Statius Niger, sevir Augustalis, worshipper of the divine house(?), [---], legate of the guild of timber-workers for the colony A(---?) Augusta of Mediolanum, and Gaius Valerius Iulianus, lion-priest [of Mithras] and legate. They fulfilled their vow gladly and deservedly.</p>
            </div>
